{"id":"59362914-daa8-4847-abed-3ba76fa3c974","revision":0,"last_node_id":257,"last_link_id":385,"nodes":[{"id":122,"type":"VAEDecode","pos":[480,5060],"size":[230,60],"flags":{"collapsed":false},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"samples","type":"LATENT","link":280},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":251}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[258,283,355]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.1","Node name for S&R":"VAEDecode","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":125,"type":"SamplerCustomAdvanced","pos":[150,5110],"size":[230,326],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"噪波","name":"noise","type":"NOISE","link":253},{"localized_name":"引导器","name":"guider","type":"GUIDER","link":254},{"localized_name":"采样器","name":"sampler","type":"SAMPLER","link":255},{"localized_name":"西格玛","name":"sigmas","type":"SIGMAS","link":256},{"localized_name":"Latent图像","name":"latent_image","type":"LATENT","link":271}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"output","type":"LATENT","links":[280]},{"localized_name":"降噪Latent","name":"denoised_output","type":"LATENT","links":[]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.1","Node name for S&R":"SamplerCustomAdvanced","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":126,"type":"BasicGuider","pos":[-260,5080],"size":[360,60],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":382},{"localized_name":"条件","name":"conditioning","type":"CONDITIONING","link":270}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"引导器","name":"GUIDER","type":"GUIDER","links":[254]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.1","Node name for S&R":"BasicGuider","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":129,"type":"RandomNoise","pos":[-260,4940],"size":[360,90],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"噪波随机种","name":"noise_seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"noise_seed"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"噪波","name":"NOISE","type":"NOISE","links":[253]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.1","Node name for S&R":"RandomNoise","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"noise_seed":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[964391386835035,"randomize"]},{"id":130,"type":"CreateVideo","pos":[1246.518270936567,5442.594965185288],"size":[270,110],"flags":{"collapsed":true},"order":26,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":258},{"localized_name":"音频","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"localized_name":"帧率","name":"fps","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"fps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"bit_depth","name":"bit_depth","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"bit_depth"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"VIDEO","type":"VIDEO","links":[260]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.1","Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"fps":true,"bit_depth":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[24,8]},{"id":140,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1875.74454979837,4876.608866509161],"size":[300,520],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note: Size Settings Reference","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["| megapixels | Aspect | Output (multiple=32) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n| 1.2 | 16:9 | 1504 x 832 |\n| 1.5 | 16:9 | 1664 x 928 |\n| 1.8 | 16:9 | 1824 x 1024 |\n| 2.0 | 16:9 | 1920 x 1088 |\n"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":117,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-2381.7082816372676,4882.51048471385],"size":[440,740],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note: Model Links","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## Model Links\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**text_encoders**\n\n- [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   ├── minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 text_encoders/\n│       └── qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":142,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-2003.5576931368607,5717.005968007735],"size":[460,980],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"README — H3 Character Sheet Maker","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# H3 Character Sheet Maker\n\nTurn up to **9 reference images** into a clean six-view character sheet in a single generation.\n\nFeed it a face, an outfit, a weapon and a hat, and H3 will assemble them into one coherent character,\nthen show you that character from four sides plus two face close-ups.\n\n---\n\n## Why a video model\n\nSix separate image generations of the same character will disagree with each other — the jaw shifts,\nthe jacket changes, the palette drifts. Six frames from **one** video generation physically cannot,\nbecause they share a single denoising pass.\n\nThis workflow renders one continuous 360° orbit, pulls six frames out of it, and stitches them into a\nsheet. No hard cuts anywhere, so nothing gets a chance to reinvent itself between shots. The camera\ndoes all the moving; the character stays frozen.\n\n---\n\n## Quick start\n\n1. **Load your references.** Any mix of photos, drawings or anime art. The first one sets the style.\n2. **Fill in `Input Text (Prompt)`** — one line per image saying what to take and what to ignore.\n3. **Pick your size** on the Resolution Selector: aspect ratio, then megapixels.\n4. **Leave duration at 5.** Everything downstream is tuned to it.\n5. Queue. The finished sheet lands in `ComfyUI/output/charsheet/`.\n\n---\n\n## The two prompt boxes\n\nThey get joined together automatically, so you only ever touch the first one.\n\n**`Input Text (Prompt)`** — yours. Assign every image one job and one ignore list:\n\n```\n<Picture 1> - keep the photo style. Use the bald head, facial hair, physique.\n<Picture 2> - keep only the black outfit. Remove the hair, remove accessories.\n<Picture 3> - use the shield. It is attached to the man's back.\n```\n\nBeing blunt about what to *ignore* matters as much as what to keep. Backgrounds, poses and the wrong\nperson's face all travel across unless you rule them out by name.\n\nDescribe fabrics and materials **in words** too. Faces carry across on their own; wardrobe drifts.\n\"Black high-collared coat with silver buckles\" survives where \"the outfit from `<Picture 2>`\" wanders.\n\n**`Prompt for orbiting`** — the fixed half. Backdrop, lighting, lens, the A-pose, the statue lock and\nthe three beat timings. Leave it alone unless you're changing the shot structure, and if you do, see\n*Retiming* below.\n\n---\n\n## What you get\n\n| # | View | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Front | orbit 0% |\n| 2 | Left side | orbit 25% |\n| 3 | Back | orbit 50% |\n| 4 | Right side | orbit 75% |\n| 5 | Face, front | beat 2 |\n| 6 | Face, three-quarter | beat 3 |\n\nLaid out 3 wide × 2 tall with thin black gutters.\n\n---\n\n## Settings worth knowing\n\n**Duration — leave at 5.** That's 124 frames. Valid lengths are `17n + 5`: 5, 22, 39, 56, 73, 90,\n107, 124. Anything else rounds up. 124 puts the orbit at roughly 100°/s, an ordinary turntable speed.\nGo much shorter and the spin outruns the model — it smears past about 5° per frame.\n\n**Aspect ratio.** Portrait for people. 9:16 wastes the least frame on a standing figure.\n\n**Megapixels.** 0.5 to scout, 0.7 for normal use, 1.2+ when you want the face crops to hold up. Cost\nscales roughly linearly, so prove the composition cheap before you commit.\n\n**Speed-up nodes.** Sage Attention and caching both cost some prompt adherence here. Deliberately left out. Add them if you like.\n\n**Optional outputs.** Two extra save nodes are bypassed by default: every individual frame, and the\nraw video. Un-bypass either if you want to cherry-pick your own angles.\n\n---\n\n## Getting good results\n\n**Give it a back view if you have one.** With only front-facing references the entire back of your\ncharacter is invented. This is the single biggest quality lever in the workflow, and no amount of\nprompt tuning substitutes for it.\n\n**Watch for flutter.** Hair and cloth want to move. The fixed prompt already freezes them hard; if\nsomething still ripples, name the specific offender in your input box.\n\n**Assembling from many sources?** If the character is built from three or more images, consider two\nstages: run once to get a clean front view, then feed *that* render back in as `<Picture 1>` and\nbuild the sheet from it. A purpose-made reference beats a pile of contradictory ones.\n\n**Retiming.** The six grab points are locked to the beat timings in the fixed prompt. If you change\nthose times or the duration, open the subgraph and move the frame indexes to match, or the grabs will\nland mid-transition.\n\n---\n\n## Then what\n\nUse the character sheet how you would like. You can input it as a reference for future H3 video generation, use it for custom DnD character, use it for visualizing characters or props. "],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":136,"type":"MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo","pos":[-750.5131581182308,4940],"size":[410,384],"flags":{},"order":20,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":272},{"localized_name":"VAE","name":"vae","type":"VAE","link":273},{"localized_name":"音频 VAE","name":"audio_vae","type":"VAE","link":274},{"label":"ref_image_0","localized_name":"ref_images.ref_image_0","name":"ref_images.ref_image_0","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":278},{"label":"ref_image_1","localized_name":"ref_images.ref_image_1","name":"ref_images.ref_image_1","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":376},{"label":"ref_image_2","localized_name":"ref_images.ref_image_2","name":"ref_images.ref_image_2","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":377},{"label":"ref_image_3","localized_name":"ref_images.ref_image_3","name":"ref_images.ref_image_3","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"label":"ref_video_0","localized_name":"ref_videos.ref_video_0","name":"ref_videos.ref_video_0","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"label":"ref_video_audio_0","localized_name":"ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0","name":"ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"label":"ref_audio_0","localized_name":"ref_audios.ref_audio_0","name":"ref_audios.ref_audio_0","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"localized_name":"提示词","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":354},{"localized_name":"宽度","name":"width","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"width"},"link":347},{"localized_name":"高度","name":"height","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"height"},"link":348},{"localized_name":"视频帧数","name":"length","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"length"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"参考图像尺寸","name":"ref_image_size","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"ref_image_size"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"正向条件","name":"positive","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[270]},{"localized_name":"Latent","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[271]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.33.1","Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"prompt":true,"width":true,"height":true,"length":true,"ref_image_size":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["",768,1344,124,"max"]},{"id":124,"type":"BasicScheduler","pos":[-260,5310],"size":[370,130],"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"model","type":"MODEL","link":383},{"localized_name":"调度器","name":"scheduler","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"scheduler"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"步数","name":"steps","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"steps"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"降噪","name":"denoise","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"denoise"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{